@* ABOUTME: Privacy Policy page describing how user data is collected, used, and protected.
   ABOUTME: Static legal content page accessible at /privacy. *@

@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy Policy — Event Platform</PageTitle>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.Medium" Class="py-8">
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h4" HtmlTag="h1" Class="mb-6" Style="font-weight: 800;">Privacy Policy</MudText>

    <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Color="Color.Secondary" Class="mb-6">
        Last updated: March 1, 2026
    </MudText>

    <section class="mb-6">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2" Style="font-weight: 700;">1. Information We Collect</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
            When you create an account or use this event platform, we may collect your name, email address, profile
            information, and event interaction data. We also collect usage data such as pages visited and actions
            taken on the Platform.
        </MudText>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2" Style="font-weight: 700;">2. How We Use Your Information</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
            We use your information to provide and improve the Platform, personalize your experience, communicate
            with you about events and updates, and ensure platform security and integrity.
        </MudText>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2" Style="font-weight: 700;">3. Data Sharing</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
            We do not sell your personal data. We may share information with service providers who help operate
            the Platform, or when required by law. Event organizers may see attendee information for events you
            register for.
        </MudText>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2" Style="font-weight: 700;">4. Data Storage and Security</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
            Your data is stored securely and we implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to
            protect it. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.
        </MudText>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2" Style="font-weight: 700;">5. Your Rights</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
            You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. You may also request data
            portability or object to certain processing activities. Contact us to exercise these rights.
        </MudText>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2" Style="font-weight: 700;">6. Cookies</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
            We use essential cookies for authentication and session management. Analytics cookies may be used
            to understand Platform usage patterns and improve our services.
        </MudText>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-6">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2" Style="font-weight: 700;">7. Changes to This Policy</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1" Class="mb-4">
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes
            by posting a notice on the Platform.
        </MudText>
    </section>

    <section>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h6" Class="mb-2" Style="font-weight: 700;">8. Contact</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
            For questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact the instance operator.
        </MudText>
    </section>
</MudContainer>
